{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Neon Fragments is a first-person shooter set in a dystopian near future.</strong></i><br>In a world of despair and suffering, the ones you can call your own are your everything. Neon Fragments is a game about <strong>loss</strong>, about <strong>love</strong>,  about <strong>actions</strong> and about <strong>hope</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641020/extras/ezgif-61f4273a59fa41.gif?t=1760128343\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A WORLD TO EXPLORE</strong><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641020/extras/ezgif-77bcfbc2612ba5.gif?t=1760128343\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When nations fought, innocents died. Great Damage was done, The oceans rose, infrastructure crumbled. Humanity left isolated in pockets of small settlements. Trying their best to survive. with the weight of billions of lost souls on their back, those who live, live in deep sorrow. In this world of grey , she is the color in your life. The only thing in this dark bottomless ocean to latch on to. Everything that ever matters and more.<br><br><strong>SATISFYING</strong> <strong>COMBAT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641020/extras/ezgif-5d96af39d84b61.gif?t=1760128343\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When something you care deeply about is taken from you, You must fight. With everything you have, everything you find, against the ones who wronged you. shoot them with guns ,\u00a0  Chase them in Vehicles, Solve the puzzles that life throws at you, Stop at nothing.\u00a0<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"